{"kind":"meta","id":"project/main","title":"專案任務板（任務表與進度）","keywords":["專案","任務","進度","表格","專案管理"],"entry":"build","standalone":true}
{"kind":"param","name":"title","default":"專案任務板","ask":"視窗標題要寫什麼？"}
{"kind":"param","name":"project","default":"嗨投資改版","ask":"專案名稱要寫什麼？"}
{"kind":"require","module":"gui","source":"builtin"}
{"kind":"style","palette":{"bg":"#f9fafb","fg":"#111827","accent":"#0d9488","danger":"#dc2626","muted":"#9ca3af"},"font":"sans-serif","size":14,"radius":6}
{"kind":"layout","window":{"title":"{{title}}","width":640,"resizable":true},"tree":[{"kind":"column","children":[{"slot":"toolbar"},{"kind":"row","children":[{"id":"task_name","kind":"entry","value":""},{"id":"add_hint","kind":"label","text":"在左邊輸入新任務名稱，按「新增任務」"}]},{"kind":"row","children":[{"id":"pct_input","kind":"entry","value":"50"},{"id":"set_pct","kind":"button","text":"設定所選任務進度"}]},{"id":"task_pick","kind":"list","items":["1. 規劃需求","2. 設計畫面"],"selected":"1. 規劃需求"},{"id":"tasks","kind":"table","columns":["任務","負責人","狀態","進度(%)"],"rows":[["規劃需求","小王","進行中","40"],["設計畫面","小李","未開始","0"]]},{"id":"overall","kind":"progress","value":20,"max":100},{"id":"overall_text","kind":"label","text":"整體進度 20%（2 項任務）"},{"id":"report_text","kind":"label","text":""},{"id":"back","kind":"button","text":"返回任務板"},{"slot":"statusbar"}]}]}
{"kind":"slot","name":"toolbar","use":"project/toolbar","params":{}}
{"kind":"slot","name":"statusbar","use":"project/statusbar","params":{"project":"{{project}}"}}
{"kind":"scene","id":"board","title":"任務板","note":"任務表、所選任務的進度、整體進度","show":["task_name","add_hint","pct_input","set_pct","task_pick","tasks","overall","overall_text"],"hide":["report_text","back"],"on":{"click:report":"report","shortcut:report":"report"}}
{"kind":"scene","id":"report","title":"進度報告","note":"只顯示文字報告","show":["report_text","back"],"hide":["task_name","add_hint","pct_input","set_pct","task_pick","tasks","overall","overall_text"],"on":{"click:back":"board"}}
{"kind":"shortcut","keys":"Ctrl+N","do":"add"}
{"kind":"shortcut","keys":"F6","do":"report"}
